      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Chesnee,_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Clinchfield Railroad spurred the development of Chesnee, with an inaugural excursion train marking its completion on October 23, 1909.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        8,
        13,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
