        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Chesnee,_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Chesnee was officially chartered on March 7, 1911, following the establishment of a local post office in 1910.",
